TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Hee hee{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ne diyorsun?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Evimdeki her şey
aşırı havalı! En azından bence öyle!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Gözüne bir şey takılırsa söyle.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Ne olduğuna bağlı olarak belki anlaşırız!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Aslında...
Ben iyiyim.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I love all my stuff{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} But I might be
willing to let something go, if you
want to strike a deal.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Does anything interest you?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Yeah!
Not really...

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Me chiiiiiiiiflan mis cosas{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Pero
si me propones un trato, no me
importa desprenderme de alguna...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}¿Hay algo que te interese?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
¡Pues sí!
No te creas...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Bütün eşyalarımı seviyorum{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Ama
bir şey çok hoşuna gittiyse belki pazarlığa
açık olabilirim.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}İlgini çeken bir şey var mı?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Evet!
Pek sayılmaz...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ogni cosa qui ha il suo perché.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Non sei d'accordo anche tu?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}
Ed è tutto in buono stato.
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Non posso giurartelo ma{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} se ti
piace qualcosa e prometti di averne
cura, magari puoi averla!{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Promesso!
No, grazie.
